ws/tools/remote.bazelrc: "# Remote build execution (RBE) — generated by `bazel run //tools/remote:setup`.\n# Non-secret + committed. The API key lives in the git-ignored user.bazelrc.\n# Opt in per build with `--config=remote` (never breaks offline/local builds).\ncommon:remote --remote_executor=grpcs://remote.buildbuddy.io\ncommon:remote --remote_cache=grpcs://remote.buildbuddy.io\ncommon:remote --bes_backend=grpcs://remote.buildbuddy.io\ncommon:remote --bes_results_url=https://app.buildbuddy.io/invocation/\ncommon:remote --remote_timeout=10m\ncommon:remote --jobs=50\ncommon:remote --remote_download_outputs=minimal\n# Default Linux execution platform/container for RBE actions. The image must ship\n# a modern glibc (>=2.28) for current Node/Python toolchains AND a modern git\n# (>=2.28) for tests/tools that use `git init -b`, `git switch`, etc. Ubuntu\n# 22.04 (rbe-ubuntu22-04) provides git 2.34 / glibc 2.35. Adjust to match your\n# toolchains. NOTE: macOS targets cannot run on Linux RBE — keep them local.\n# See docs/guides/remote-build.md.\ncommon:remote --remote_default_exec_properties=OSFamily=linux\ncommon:remote --remote_default_exec_properties=container-image=docker://gcr.io/flame-public/rbe-ubuntu22-04:latest\n\n# Cache-only profile (--config=remotecache): share the BuildBuddy remote cache +\n# BES but WITHOUT remote execution — outputs stay local, actions run locally.\n# Remote-cache I/O errors fall back to local execution; BES upload is fully\n# async so it never blocks or fails the build.\ncommon:remotecache --remote_cache=grpcs://remote.buildbuddy.io\ncommon:remotecache --bes_backend=grpcs://remote.buildbuddy.io\ncommon:remotecache --bes_results_url=https://app.buildbuddy.io/invocation/\ncommon:remotecache --bes_upload_mode=fully_async\ncommon:remotecache --remote_timeout=10m\n"
ws/user.bazelrc: "# >>> build cache (managed by tools/remote:setup) — do not edit by hand\ncommon --config=remotecache\ncommon --remote_header=x-buildbuddy-api-key=TYPEDKEY\ncommon --bes_header=x-buildbuddy-api-key=TYPEDKEY\ncommon:remotecache --remote_upload_local_results\n# <<< build cache (managed by tools/remote:setup)\n"
=== case: no key
exit: 2
